              "content": "=You are an expert AI image prompt engineer. Given this LinkedIn post:\n\n\"\"\"\n{{ $('Store Post Data').item.json.postContent }}\n\"\"\"\n\nCreate a single, detailed image generation prompt that:\n- Visually represents the core message and key concept of the post\n- Uses a modern, corporate-tech aesthetic with clean floating 3D elements\n- Includes style descriptors: isometric, vibrant professional colors, soft studio lighting, 8k resolution\n- Is optimized for Stable Diffusion XL\n- Does NOT include any text, words, letters, watermarks, or signatures in the image\n- Includes a negative prompt section\n\nReturn your response in this exact JSON format:\n{\"prompt\": \"your detailed image prompt here\", \"negative_prompt\": \"text, words, letters, watermark, signature, ugly, blurry, deformed\"}\n\nReturn ONLY the JSON, nothing else."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert AI image prompt engineer. Always respond with valid JSON only."
        }
